    {
      "title": "Getting Started",
      "slug": "getting-started",
      "displayOrder": 1,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 778,
        "lessonOrder": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "\r\n<h3>Why Cut 'n Sew?</h3>\r\nAs machine knitters we can create raw knitted \"fabric\" fairly quickly. Thinking of our knitting as fabric opens new possibilities for creating garments.\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Create your own knitted fabric</li>\r\n\t<li>No shaping - many knitters are intimidated by necklines (or they don't want to take the time to shape them)</li>\r\n\t<li>Shaping while knitting in pattern can be a challenge and time consuming. Cut 'n sew eliminates shaping on the machine</li>\r\n\t<li>Use sewing patterns for fabulous, updated garment styles</li>\r\n\t<li>Alter / resize / remake existing garments to fit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br><h3>The biggest challenges to Cut 'n Sew?</h3>\r\n<ul class=\"lightlist\" style=\"list-style:none;\">\r\n\t<li>Getting over the fear of cutting your knitting</li>\r\n\t<li>Creating templates or finding patterns</li>\r\n\t<li>Stabilizing the fabric</li>\r\n\t<li>Finishing the edges and adding bands</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/path/images/101/fearless_cut_n_sew.jpg\">\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 9537,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "Why Cut 'n Sew",
          "slug": "why-cut-n-sew",
          "order": 2,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 6221,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "151819909",
              "title": "Introduction to Cut and Sew",
              "legacyComponentId": 9538,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "Introduction to Cut 'n Sew",
          "slug": "introduction-to-cut-n-sew",
          "order": 3,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 6222,
            "blockType": "Video"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "Olga Lynn specializes in using knit fabric for sewing garments.  Although she is a machine knitter, her approach is more sewing focused.<br>Check out our conversation about sewing with knits.",
              "legacyComponentId": 9562,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "861767300",
              "title": null,
              "legacyComponentId": 9561,
              "order": 2
            }
          ],
          "title": "Live with O Jolly",
          "slug": "live-with-o-jolly",
          "order": 4,
