    {
      "title": "Stuff you Should Know",
      "slug": "stuff-you-should-know",
      "displayOrder": 2,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 779,
        "lessonOrder": 2
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "We recently explored using stabilizers to improve our cut ‘n sew skills … and we were pleasantly surprised!<br>Watch as we learn 3 Cut ‘n Sew lessons:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easier Sewing</li>\r\n<li>More precise shaping</li>\r\n<li>Wash-away stabilizer really washes away!</li>\r\n</ul>",
              "legacyComponentId": 9539,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "280094859",
              "title": "Stabilizer for Cut 'n Sew Excellence",
              "legacyComponentId": 9540,
              "order": 2
            }
          ],
          "title": "Stabilizer Trick",
          "slug": "stabilizer-trick",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 6223,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "\r\n\r\nPrintable templates for cut 'n sew necklines.\r\n<ul class=\"lightlist\" style=\"list-style:none;\">\r\n<li>From infant to adult size</li>\r\n<li>Neck depths up to 7\" (18cm)</li>\r\n<li>Both Letter (US) and A4 (Metric) versions are included</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Create a perfectly shaped neckline every time!</b><br><div class=\"lead\">Cut 'n Sew necklines are easy and fast!<br>The Steps:</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knit your garment with no neckline shaping.</li>\r\n<li>Select a template for the desired neckline width and depth.</li>\r\n<li>Use the template to mark the shape</li>\r\n<li>Machine stitch along the marks to secure the edge</li>\r\n<li>Cut your neck opening</li>\r\n<li>Use an \"industrial\" band to neatly hide the cut edges.</li>\r\n<li>No shaping as you knit!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<center></center>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/downloads/cut-n-sew-neckline-template.pdf\"><img class=\"img-thumbnail zoom\" src=\"/path/images/101/template_img_500.jpg\"></a>\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 9542,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "Knit it Now Printable Templates",
          "slug": "knit-it-now-printable-templates",
          "order": 3,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 6225,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "DesignaKnit 9 has expanded the possibilities with Cut 'n Sew.<br>In addition to creating templates, learn more about how Stitch Designer can improve your knitting with Cut 'n Sew.<br>\r\nThe complete course is at <a href=\"https://learndesignaknit.com/courses/11/stitch-designer\"><b>LearnDesignaKnit.com/stitchdesigner201</b></a>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"style13\">\r\n\r\n\r\nUse DAK (8 or 9) to create your own neckline templates<br>\r\n <div class=\"videopopup\" data-videotitle=\"DAK: EZ Cut \\'N Sew Neckline Template\" data-vimeoid=\"344808537\">\r\n\t\t<img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/794399190-69f659f08fb01a50ebed74e1dfee960a6d09bb6081ca1ac9cdebd9866caa8f59-d_1280x720?r=pad\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"imagecenter text-center\"><button class=\"btn btn-sm\"><i class=\"fa fa-youtube-play fa-2x learn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div>\t\t\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 9563,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
